DeFleur Video workflow helpers

The directory defleur/ in this source tree (installed at /opt/defleur in the
image) contains James DeFleur's DeFleur Video plugin files, copied unchanged
from upstream commit 30768288eb1308b18216a5df5eb4648fbce3e55b: README.md,
SETUP.md, plugin.json, package.json, wizard-module.json, requirements.txt,
defaults/neutral-preset.json and the skills defleur-edit, defleur-audio and
defleur-motion (SKILL.md, references and scripts).

The plugin's plugin.json declares the license "MIT". They are redistributed in
this Humanity Labs app with the author's authorization.

Everything else in images/defleur-video (service.py, workflow.py,
transcriber.py, scan_windows.py, editing.py, client.py, tests and docs) is
original to this app. The app does not modify James' scripts; it runs them with
server-owned paths and records each script's SHA-256 in every job result.
